17:34 error[E0810]: Binary operator combines operands of different essential type categories (integer and floating)
       help: MISRA C:2012 Rule 10.4: both operands must share an essential type category. Convert the integer operand with an explicit cast, e.g. (f32)value (ADR-024).
22:32 error[E0811]: Binary operator combines an integer operand and a header macro whose type cnx cannot read
       help: ADR-024: a header macro is typed from its replacement tokens, and this one's are not a literal expression; this operator would hand it to an overflow helper untyped. Cast the macro to the type it has, e.g. (u32)MACRO or (f32)MACRO.
27:37 error[E0812]: Binary operator combines an integer operand and a header macro whose type cnx cannot read
       help: ADR-024: a header macro is typed from its replacement tokens, and this one's are not a literal expression; C's usual arithmetic conversions decide this result from the type it really has, which can change a comparison, a bit operation or a quotient (an unsigned 3 < -1 is true). Cast the macro to the type it has, e.g. (u32)MACRO or (f32)MACRO.
